    /// v0.8.129 (W1-4/W1-5) -- EVERY COUNTED SELECTION STRING IS COMPOSED IN RUST.
    ///
    /// Slint 1.17 has no int+string concatenation, and the house rule (support.rs' own divergence
    /// note) is that a counted entry is published, never re-derived UI-side. These are those strings.
    ///
    /// FALSIFIER (L28): change any wording here and the row fails; move the composition into
